name demo
make screen flash, play sound
name hello
Clear the screen, say hello world, new line, print the number 1234, new line, print "Bye!", do it 2 times
name blue
make the screen blue
name wait2
wait two seconds
name noise
beep at 880 hertz for half a second, play a siren
name all
clear the screen, flash the screen twice, make the screen red, make the text yellow, green border, go to row 3 column 5, hide the cursor, show the cursor, play a tune, wait for a key, say all done, new line
name fixed
make the cursor invisible, make an alarm sound, hold on for half a second, display the text all fixed, new line
name bad
format the hard disk
beep at 5 hertz
mem
quit
